Description:

The dblookup email2uids, email2details and uid2groups endpoints now search
the addressbook marked isDefault when the request names no Mailbox, instead
of the addressbook called "Default".  ContactCard/set likewise files a
new card with no addressBookIds into the addressbook marked isDefault, and
CardDAV refuses to DELETE that addressbook rather than the one called
"Default".


